1
00:00:47,119 --> 00:00:48,880
It's alright, it's alright.

2
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:49,920
Cousin is here.

3
00:00:50,119 --> 00:00:52,039
It's okay. You're fine, you're fine.

4
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,039
Who do you think you are?

5
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,119
Ling Yu.

6
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,120
Ling Yu.

7
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:29,120
It's all your fault.

8
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:31,120
You just had to open that Cursed Jar!

9
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:33,280
Look what you've done to my cousin!

10
00:01:33,519 --> 00:01:34,879
I'm talking to you!

11
00:01:34,879 --> 00:01:35,879
Don't you have any manners?

12
00:01:35,879 --> 00:01:36,799
We have to find that little girl.

13
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:38,239
Otherwise, we can't cure this Coffin Urn Corpse Poison.

14
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:39,040
Let's go.

15
00:01:42,719 --> 00:01:44,719
You're really going? Wait for me!

16
00:01:45,359 --> 00:01:46,159
Zhang Tianyou.

17
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,920
You wouldn't leave me behind, right?

18
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,040
As long as I'm in the Sheng Family,

19
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,079
I will protect you.

20
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:50,879
Young Master,

21
00:01:52,159 --> 00:01:54,480
these stairs here are so weird.

22
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,239
Zhang Tianyou,

23
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,079
even though you're just a Wandering geomancer,

24
00:02:04,959 --> 00:02:06,640
you're actually quite manly.

25
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,560
Miss,

26
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,599
our Young Master is more than just manly.

27
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:11,120
Think about that Imp from earlier.

28
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,800
It dared to touch anyone,

29
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,719
except for the Young Master.

30
00:02:12,719 --> 00:02:13,520
What does that mean?

31
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,800
Extraordinary destiny, feared by ghosts and gods.

32
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,680
Just luck, just luck.

33
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,560
Whoa, a secondary infection so soon!

34
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,759
Go, go, go! Hurry!

35
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,719
What happened to Cousin?

36
00:02:57,159 --> 00:02:58,159
He's infected with corpse poison.

37
00:02:58,159 --> 00:02:59,199
He's already delirious.

38
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:01,039
Then... what do we do now?

39
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,960
There's nothing we can do.

40
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:06,639
They had it coming.

41
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,639
Heaven's will cannot be defied.

42
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:10,360
We can only hit their death point

43
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:12,439
and take their lives.

44
00:03:14,879 --> 00:03:17,000
Zhang Tianyou, are you really going to kill them?

45
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,000
What? Can't bear to lose your dear Cousin?

46
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,159
That's not what I meant.

47
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:22,319
I... I was just lying to them before.

48
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:24,159
It's because the Sheng Family needs the Qi Family's support.

49
00:03:24,199 --> 00:03:26,960
Actually, you're the one I've always liked!

50
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:29,919
I found a door!

51
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:31,800
Ling Yu, hurry!

52
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,879
Hold them off for now!

53
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:08,439
Ling Yu!

54
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,519
Is Miss Ling Yu inside?

55
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,920
Young Master, think of something quickly!

56
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:21,120
A child turned into an Urn Corpse.

57
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,959
Listen, my ancient little friend.

58
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,839
We have no past grievances,

59
00:05:26,839 --> 00:05:27,959
nor recent grudges.

60
00:05:28,079 --> 00:05:30,199
I'm sending you to your Mom right now

61
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,800
to be reunited.

62
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:36,680
So you'd better behave.

63
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,920
Dragon-Seeking Ruler

64
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:07,240
Ling Yu

65
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,959
The red mark on your hand is gone.

66
00:06:10,199 --> 00:06:11,399
I'll pull you out!

67
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,360
Let's go!

68
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,199
Come on.

69
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:25,399
Are you two having your Wedding night here?

70
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,199
That's twisted enough, I like it.

71
00:06:28,199 --> 00:06:29,000
Go away!

72
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,680
Get off!

73
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:33,720
Ling Yu!

74
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,240
Hurry, get up!

75
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:35,800
Cousin!

76
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,639
Did he hurt you?

77
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,399
Don't sit down!

78
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:02,839
Tiankun!

79
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:06,160
Your butt's busted!

80
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:27,199
Oh my god

81
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,759
Not again

82
00:07:41,079 --> 00:07:41,759
Run!

83
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:44,879
Treasure!

84
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,639
Rat!

85
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:52,720
Rat!

86
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,720
Hold them off for a bit.

87
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,920
Let me get them out of here,

88
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,040
then I'll come back and save you!

89
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:04,279
One yellow talisman,

90
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,600
to jointly suppress and cleanse.

91
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,319
Father!

92
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:14,319
Tiankun, what happened to you?

93
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:15,800
What's with your hair?

94
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,199
Father.

95
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,160
Are you okay, son?

96
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:23,120
Ling Yu!

97
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:24,079
Mom!

98
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:26,920
You scared me to death.

99
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:28,079
You're not hurt, are you?

100
00:08:28,079 --> 00:08:29,920
Father, I didn't fail my mission.

101
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,439
I brought Ling Yu back.

102
00:08:31,759 --> 00:08:35,480
But I couldn't find the relic of the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family.

103
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,399
I'm just glad you're back.

104
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:39,840
As long as you're okay.

105
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:42,000
As for locating the Tidal Tomb,

106
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,320
we can talk about that later.

107
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:43,799
Okay.

108
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:44,960
You did a great job.

109
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,120
You really did Father proud.

110
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:46,759
Yes.

111
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,759
Let's go, let's head back.

112
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,279
Okay.

113
00:08:55,559 --> 00:08:56,519
It's this punk.

114
00:08:56,519 --> 00:08:57,320
It's him.

115
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,799
He almost got Ling Yu killed.

116
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,240
What?

117
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,720
Ling Yu!

118
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:04,039
What did this bastard do to you?

119
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:05,279
Aunt Sheng.

120
00:09:05,279 --> 00:09:07,720
When none of us were looking, this punk

121
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:10,480
tried to have his Wedding night with Cousin Ling Yu in the secret room!

122
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,639
If my brother hadn't arrived in time,

123
00:09:12,759 --> 00:09:14,679
he would have gotten his way!

124
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,000
I thought getting a loser to marry into the family

125
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:20,120
meant he'd treat Ling Yu better.

126
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,279
I didn't realize I was Bringing a wolf home.

127
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,679
If you say so.

128
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,159
That rat is still inside.

129
00:09:27,159 --> 00:09:27,960
Perfect, let's go.

130
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,759
Come back with me and save him.

131
00:09:28,759 --> 00:09:29,720
Save him?

132
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,360
You should look out for yourself first.

133
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,600
You might have no shame,

134
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,960
but our Qi Family still cares about our dignity.

135
00:09:36,039 --> 00:09:38,639
Your Sheng Family really found a good Young Master.

136
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:41,080
He really does the Sheng Family proud!

137
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:42,840
Tianting,

138
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:43,919
let's go, we're leaving.

139
00:09:43,919 --> 00:09:44,720
Yes, Father.

140
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,799
Father!

141
00:09:52,799 --> 00:09:54,000
What exactly happened?

142
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:54,720
Mom.

143
00:09:55,159 --> 00:09:56,799
We didn't find the Dragon-Seeking Ruler,

144
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:58,519
and he almost got his way.

145
00:09:58,919 --> 00:10:01,120
How are we supposed to win over the Qi Family now?

146
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,720
I need to hurry and find Cousin to fix things.

147
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,759
I...

148
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,360
Cousin!

149
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,360
Cousin!

150
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:10,840
You brat!

151
00:10:11,279 --> 00:10:13,000
You've only been here for a few days,

152
00:10:13,159 --> 00:10:15,120
and you've already made the Sheng Family lose face.

153
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,799
With your behavior,

154
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:20,200
do you even deserve to be part of the Sheng Family?

155
00:10:23,279 --> 00:10:23,960
What?

156
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,799
I don't deserve it?

157
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,399
Then I'll leave.

158
00:10:27,679 --> 00:10:28,240
What?

159
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,240
Madam Sheng.

160
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:32,600
Your Sheng Family is a noble house,

161
00:10:33,399 --> 00:10:34,639
so why would you look for someone

162
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:37,960
of humble origins like me to be your son-in-law?

163
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:40,960
I'm sure you know better than I do.
